{"overview":"«S» یک مسابقهٔ خطرناک، فوق‌العاده محرمانه و بدون هیچ‌قیدی برای اسکی‌بورد سواری در مسیر پایین‌شیب یک معدن متروکه است. وقتی اسکیت‌بوردسوار پرشور رکی، لانگا را به کوهستانی می‌برد که «S» در آن برگزار می‌شود، لانگا که تا به حال یک بار اسکی‌بورد نزده، به دنیای «S» کشیده می‌شود و…؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"\"S\" is a dangerous, top secret, no-holds-barred downhill skateboarding race down an abandoned mine. When avid skateboarder Reki takes Langa to the mountain where \"S\" is held, Langa, who's never been on a skateboard in his life, finds himself sucked into the world of \"S\", and…?!","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":2021,"poster":"/3zoC4MzKlxIwZUQkbWfilhCTlx8.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2021,"poster":"/9eJ9RhdXqrkWURK8j3pTDOBMVqc.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小林千晃","role":"Langa Hasegawa (voice)","photo":"/o0XZFXc50z28ICUpvfZ1QcTL2Yt.jpg","en":"Chiaki Kobayashi"},{"name":"تاسوکو هاتاناکا","role":"Reki Kyan (voice)","photo":"/xPDqoxAia1ShoVC2aMS2ZDPDWzG.jpg","en":"Tasuku Hatanaka"},{"name":"子安武人","role":"Adam (voice)","photo":"/8uBkNDKPNmp9JWgMUI02NVyfhi1.jpg","en":"Takehito Koyasu"},{"name":"緑川光","role":"Cherry blossom (voice)","photo":"/pvzfUDE9UruEhRBrONVFk83o6Zh.jpg","en":"Hikaru Midorikawa"},{"name":"永塚拓馬","role":"Miya Chinen (voice)","photo":"/5IdSSkG5qDJ36MPX3R6oLPk557K.jpg","en":"Takuma Nagatsuka"},{"name":"یاسونوری ماتسوموتو","role":"Joe (voice)","photo":"/12vPpqoppN12i3Zk313dwQsUQYi.jpg","en":"Yasunori Matsumoto"},{"name":"کنتا میاکه","role":"Shadow (voice)","photo":"/7YL8vM2KYzPMeQqTpHWmNj6s1AP.jpg","en":"Kenta Miyake"}],"trailer":"PcS3QIc6ma8","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/110309-sk/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon V